  404:     # ---- v5 guard stage 1: chain-aware canonical-rendering guard
  405:     # (batch, TRIMMED hulls). Bible rows are exempt (a Bible page matching
  406:     # ׳׳§׳¨׳ is a Bible witness, not a leak), and so are rows whose CLAIMED
  407:     # work is itself in the guard set (Targum/tafsir/liturgy-unit claims
  408:     # would self-match their own edition ג€” the v4 Onkelos over-kill).
  409:     # Everything else must NOT be explainable as canonical rendering
