   14:      crop *within the labeled matched span* (spans_json) -- so the crop
   15:      provably belongs to work W (fixes FRAG-1's residual-15%% contamination
   16:      channel where a crop could land on an embedded quotation). Query each
   17:      crop against the reference index at a WIDE verification cutoff (0.75)
